# Easter Coconut Cake

Based on [https://www.myrecipes.com/recipe/…](https://www.myrecipes.com/recipe/coconut-sheet-cake) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20230602042340/https://www.myrecipes.com/recipe/coconut-sheet-cake))

{ rating="3" image="easter_coconut_cake.jpeg" }
:::
:::

## Ingredients

### Cake

- [ ] 3 large [eggs]{ ing="egg" }
- [ ] 8 oz [sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" } (1 container)
- [ ] 1/3 cup [water]{ ing="water" }
- [ ] 8.5-ounce [cream of coconut]{ ing="cream-of-coconut" } (1 can)
- [ ] 1/2 tsp [vanilla extract]{ ing="vanilla-extract" }
- [ ] 18.25 oz [white cake mix]{ ing="white-cake-mix" } (1 package)

### Coconut-Cream Cheese Frosting

- [ ] 8 oz [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" }, softened (1 container)
- [ ] 1/2 cup [butter]{ ing="butter" }, softened
- [ ] 3 tablespoons [milk]{ ing="milk" }
- [ ] 1 teaspoon [vanilla extract]{ ing="vanilla-extract" }
- [ ] 16 oz [powdered sugar]{ ing="powdered-sugar" }, sifted (1 package)
- [ ] 7 oz [sweetened flaked coconut]{ ing="sweetened-flaked-coconut" } (1 package)

## Recipe

1. Step 1

   1. Beat [eggs]{ ing="egg" } at high speed with an electric mixer 2 min
   1. Add [sour cream]{ ing="sour-cream" }, 1/3 cup [water]{ ing="water" }, and next 2 ingredients, beating well after each addition
   1. Add [cake mix]{ ing="white-cake-mix" }, beating at low speed until blended, then beat at high for 2 min.
   1. Pour batter into a greased and floured 13x9 inch baking pan
1. Step 2

   1. Bake at 325F for 40-45 min or until a wooden pick comes out clean. Cool cake in pan on wire rack. Cover pan with plastic wrap, and freeze cake 30 min
1. Step 3 - Frosting

   1. While cake is in the freezer, make the [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } frosting
   1. Beat [cream cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } and [butter]{ ing="butter" } at medium speed with an electric mixer until creamy; add [milk]{ ing="milk" } and vanilla, beating well
   1. Gradually add [sugar]{ ing="powdered-sugar" }, beating until smooth. Stir in [coconut]{ ing="cream-of-coconut" }
   1. Remove the cake from the freezer, and spread the [Coconut]{ ing="cream-of-coconut" }-[Cream Cheese]{ ing="cream-cheese" } Frosting on top of chilled cake. Cover and store in refrigerator

## Notes

1. Note: If desired, cake can be baked in 1 greased and floured 15- x 10-inch jellyroll pan for 30-32 min or until a wooden pick comes out clean ([Frosting Link](https://www.myrecipes.com/recipe/coconut-cream-cheese-frosting-4) ([wayback](http://web.archive.org/web/20230328082825/https://www.myrecipes.com/recipe/coconut-cream-cheese-frosting-4)))
